<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληχρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>faint, gentle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					16
				</span></i>
			; of the rivers of hell, <i>dull, sluggish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				130
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελάγη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.152
				</span></i>
			; <i>gentle</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκράχολος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.44
			</span></i> O.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. πυρετοί</span>
			<i>slight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.64
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. σφυγμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦσος -οτέρη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνου β. ὄνειαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					2.182
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>
			<i>slightly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.203
			</span></i>; <i>weakly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. εἶχον καὶ οὐκ ἰσχυρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ctes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					29.42
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.61
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>slight, small</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἀπ᾽ ἀρχᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.65
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν οὐ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					12.227
				</span></i>
			.—Not in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (who has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβληχρός</span>), nor in 
				Att.
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span> in all dialects.</div>
